I'm not sure whether this issue is specific to vim-R-plugin, but I think it might. I have in more recent time come across a frustrating issue. Say I have a code and R session open in tmux. I produce a plot. I then close the R session. Sometimes (but not always), the file then becomes empty, or if the plot was split into multiple panels, all but the first would become empty. I then have to reopen the session, re-create the plot, and hope for the best. Do you have any idea why this might be happening, or what I might be doing wrong?

